# Cargo build artifacts — relocated to
#   $XDG_CACHE_HOME/ai-workbench/agentctl-target
# by the devshell and by `just` recipes. The legacy in-tree /target is
# still ignored here in case anyone runs bare `cargo` without the devshell.
/target

# Rust panic crash dumps (large, never tracked).
/core
/core.*

# Nix output symlinks (manage locally; never commit closures).
/result
/result-*
